{
  "changes": [
    "Merged the duplicated submit-job validation branches into one flow with separate guards for cluster open and user valid.",
    "Moved the SGE-to-Libra handoff so the submit-job path reflects that SGE receives and delegates the job before Libra initializes it.",
    "Kept the accept/reject decision in Libra and made the rejected path end with a final node, with the accepted path continuing to scheduling.",
    "Refined the execution-queue loop into a proper iterative structure with a decision for jobs remaining and a FIFO tie branch that rejoins.",
    "Added the missing Libra-to-resource-manager workstation allocation communication and the resource manager dispatch step.",
    "Added the missing execution-host update steps: reserve resources, update queue status, and send load information to the central information store on the master host.",
    "Adjusted labels to short verb phrases and guards to concise phrases while preserving requirement traceability."
  ],
